        desc = "Hardware (Hi3520D V100 board, read on hardware 2026-11-08, stock U-Boot prompt after a cold boot): reads 0x0007B000: uart_cksel = 0 (APB clock) while the reset here is 1 (0x0007F000). Boot value (the boot code switches the UART to the APB clock), not taken as the reset value; everything else equals the reset.";

        enum PERI_CRG57_test_clk_sel_enum {
